; zerobus-otlp-async (§4.3): the Async instantiation of the OTLP exporter. The
; Async counterpart of zerobus-otlp (Lwt): unary LogsService / MetricsService
; Export over the Async H2 client (reuses zerobus-async's transport), with the
; same scoped OAuth grant over cohttp-async. Reuses the shared zerobus-otlp.proto
; wire types.
;
; The token mint reuses the shared pure-ocaml-tls HTTP backend from zerobus-async
; (Zerobus_async.Oauth over Tls_async.connect) — NOT cohttp-async. Builds wherever
; zerobus-async does; if tls-async is absent at build time the shared backend is
; the honest-error stub, so export returns a Transport_error rather than doing I/O.
; Not in standard CI (a live run needs credentials).
(library
 (name zerobus_otlp_async)
 (public_name zerobus-otlp-async)
 (modules zerobus_otlp_async)
 (preprocess
  (pps ppx_let))
 (libraries
  zerobus-core
  zerobus-otlp.proto
  zerobus-async
  pbrt
  core
  async
  yojson
  base64))
